  "name": "International Development Sub-Committee on the Work of the Independent Commission for Aid Impact",
  "parent_committee_id": 98,
  "purpose": "<p>The Sub-Committee on the Work of ICAI has been appointed by the International Development Committee to examine the work of the Independent Commission for Aid Impact (ICAI). The Sub-Committee operates by scrutinising ICAI's reports on value-for-money of ODA expenditure and by assessing the FCDO’s and other Government Departments’ responses to those reviews. The Sub-Committee works alongside, and reports to the <a href=\"https://www.parliament.uk/business/committees/committees-a-z/commons-select/international-development-committee/\">International Development Committee</a>, who continues to monitor ICAI, chiefly through an annual examination of ICAI's Annual Report and work programme.</p>",
